---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy and contact"
  description="How this first True Hive site handles browsing and external contact links. No checkout, customer form, or tracking feed is active."
>
  <section class="page-intro wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Keep things clear</p>
    <h1>
      Privacy,
      <br />
      <em>without surprises.</em>
    </h1>
    <p>
      This first site provides collection and service information. It does not
      accept orders, take payment, create customer accounts, or collect
      inquiry-form submissions.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap prose-section">
    <h2>Browsing this site</h2>
    <p>
      No advertising pixel, social-feed embed, or first-party customer analytics
      has been added. The application host may process request and security
      logs; the final provider-specific disclosure must be approved before
      public launch.
    </p>
    <h2>Contacting us elsewhere</h2>
    <p>
      If you use an approved phone or social-profile link, the call or platform
      interaction takes place outside this website and is subject to that
      provider's behavior. Email setup remains deferred.
    </p>
    <h2>Before online sales</h2>
    <p>
      Checkout, customer information, retention, owner access, and privacy
      disclosures will be reviewed before those features are enabled. No
      invented claim of zero provider data collection is made here.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
